 <longdesc><para unique="1261246">CLUI clears the user interrupt flag (UIF). Its effect takes place immediately: a user interrupt cannot be delivered on the instruction boundary following CLUI.</para>
  <para unique="1261247">An execution of CLUI inside a transactional region causes a transactional abort; the abort loads EAX as it would have had it been caused due to an execution of CLI.</para>
  </longdesc>
 <operation>
  <programlisting>UIF := 0;</programlisting>
  </operation>
 <subsection title="Flags Affected">
  <para unique="1261251">None.</para>
  </subsection>
 <subsection title="Protected Mode Exceptions">
  <variablelist>
   <variablelistentry>
    <term>#UD</term>
    <listitem><para unique="1261253">The CLUI instruction is not recognized in protected mode.</para>
     </listitem>
    </variablelistentry>
   </variablelist>
  </subsection>
 <subsection title="Real-Address Mode Exceptions">
  <variablelist>
   <variablelistentry>
    <term>#UD</term>
    <listitem><para unique="1261255">The CLUI instruction is not recognized in real-address mode.</para>
     </listitem>
    </variablelistentry>
   </variablelist>
  </subsection>
 <subsection title="Virtual-8086 Mode Exceptions">
  <variablelist>
   <variablelistentry>
    <term>#UD</term>
    <listitem><para unique="1261257">The CLUI instruction is not recognized in virtual-8086 mode.</para>
     </listitem>
    </variablelistentry>
   </variablelist>
  </subsection>
 <subsection title="Compatibility Mode Exceptions">
  <para unique="1261259">#UD	The CLUI instruction is not recognized in compatibility mode.</para>
  </subsection>
 <subsection title="64-Bit Mode Exceptions">
  <variablelist>
   <variablelistentry>
    <term>#UD</term>
    <listitem><para unique="1261261">If the LOCK prefix is used.</para>
     </listitem>
    <listitem><para unique="1261262">If executed inside an enclave.</para>
     </listitem>
    <listitem><para unique="1261263">If CR4.UINTR = 0.</para>
     </listitem>
    <listitem><para unique="1261264">If CPUID.07H.00H:EDX.UINTR[5] = 0.</para>
     </listitem>
    </variablelistentry>
   </variablelist>
  </subsection>
 </instruction>
